# Modules loaded by /init before the services start.
#
# Everything needed by the boot path (ext4, squashfs, overlayfs, IPv6,
# netfilter, bridge, veth) is built into the kernel: see
# board/nrzube/kernel-nrzube.fragment.
#
# The modules below are the optional ones (tunnel encapsulations, extra
# netfilter matches) that a CNI may need at runtime.

vxlan
geneve
nft_ct
nft_limit
nft_log
